        "Title": "The Selective Client",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102624790743",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository b63d263c-d156-48cc-bb8a-8f7f8c561002).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47.\r\rSince the fall of Providence, we&apos;ve had no shortage of strange clients. This one is no exception, because this is not a proper &quot;contract&quot;. He first wants you to prove you&apos;re the real deal.\r\rThree of the clients employees are disguised around the Sanguine fashion show, and are expecting you to &quot;eliminate&quot; them with no one any the wiser. One in particular is in a crowded area.\r\rIf you are successful, meet the client in the basement.\r\rGo easy on them, 47. Just like training.",
